flowchart LR
  Define[Create or learn proposal] --> Preview[Review triggers / targets / actions]
  Preview --> Approve{User approves version?}
  Approve -->|No| Dormant[Draft / Dismissed]
  Approve -->|Yes| Enabled[Enabled Routine]
  Enabled --> Trigger[Trigger arrives]
  Trigger --> Dedupe[Unique occurrence ledger]
  Dedupe --> Conditions[Recheck conditions and permissions]
  Conditions --> Actions[Execute typed steps]
  Actions --> Record[Record outcome]
  Record --> Resched[Schedule next occurrence]
  Enabled --> Pause[Pause / Disable / Delete]
  Enabled --> Edit[Edit invalidates previous approval]
  Edit --> Preview
